OL,3,GNEWSAWorld's second oldest football
OL,4,Aclub quits league
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe world's second oldest football club
OL,7,Fhas withdrawn from the league it
OL,8,Fcompetes in after warning it could run
OL,9,Fout of money by December.
OL,11,FSheffield outfit Hallam FC said it
OL,12,Fwould resign from the Northern Premier
OL,13,FLeague East - the seventh tier of
OL,14,FEnglish football - with immediate
OL,15,Feffect.
OL,17,F"In making this agonising decision we
OL,18,Fare trying to do the right thing by the
OL,19,Fclub, the players, our suppliers and
OL,20,Fthe community," a statement issued on
OL,21,FWednesday read.
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
