OL,3,GNEWSAWorld's second oldest football
OL,4,Aclub quits league
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe club's current owners blamed the
OL,7,F"perilous" situation on those
OL,8,Fpreviously in charge of its finances -
OL,9,Fa claim rejected as "seriously
OL,10,Fmisleading" by former board members.
